{"scraped_at": "2026-06-04T07:26:16.694941+00:00", "run_id": "20260604_072616", "page": 177, "api_response": {"count": 3946, "per_page": 20, "current_page": 177, "total_pages": 198, "next": "https://tripadvisor-scraper-api.omkar.cloud/reviews?query=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FAttraction_Review-g293890-d310712-Reviews-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html&page=178&sort_by=most_recent&locale=en-US", "previous": "https://tripadvisor-scraper-api.omkar.cloud/reviews?query=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tripadvisor.com%2FAttraction_Review-g293890-d310712-Reviews-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html&page=176&sort_by=most_recent&locale=en-US", "results": [{"review_id": 159882477, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r159882477-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Unbelievable", "text": "Well......what a life experience this was. We watched the ceremony from start to finish as the dead were carried to the holy river, feet bathed, and the custom of preparing the body for cremation...right through to the laying of the body on the wooden platform, placing the fire in the mouth and then covering the body and allowing the cremation to take place. Unbelievable!!!", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "friends", "stay_date": "2013-05-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "B88B103BF0B3CEC3D4EBDE62B4496679", "name": "Janette P", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/JazzyPerth", "username": "JazzyPerth", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-s/02/3e/b9/19/jazzyperth.jpg", "contribution_count": 1031, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 255103, "location_name": "Perth", "location_name_detailed": "Perth, Australia"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2013-05-07", "published_at_date": "2013-05-07"}, {"review_id": 159870866, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r159870866-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "A confronting visit.", "text": "At this temple you can easily visit THE burning ghats. Here the hindoeist people burn their relatives. In can be very confronting, so look at yourself and expessialy your children.\nIts an easy walk from here to the bouddanath stupa. Ask your way and THE people will show you.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2013-04-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "AB51A99B11669F1764384432CE6AB605", "name": "berendino", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/berendino", "username": "berendino", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/07/6f/6c/56/berendino.jpg", "contribution_count": 361, "hometown": null, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2013-05-07", "published_at_date": "2013-05-07"}, {"review_id": 159779599, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r159779599-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Pashupatinath Temple", "text": "This is the famous holiest Hindu temple of Nepal. Thousands of travelers are visited this temple during the seasons.", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "family", "stay_date": "2012-08-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "0EB9FA2113CCA12B6D81B0C5564BBDCC", "name": "Glorious H", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/glorioushimalayatrek", "usernam